---
---
<section class="location" id="localizacao">
  <div class="location__head">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal"><span>06</span> Localização</p>
      <h2 class="section-title section-title--light">
        <span class="line"><span class="line-inner">Onde o sertão</span></span>
        <span class="line"><span class="line-inner">encontra o <em>mar</em>.</span></span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="location__lead reveal">Pescaria Brava guarda um dos litorais mais selvagens e bonitos de Santa Catarina. Do chalé, tudo fica perto — e o melhor fica guardado para a volta.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="location__grid">
    <div class="location__map" data-cursor="link" data-parallax="0.05">
      <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Sert%C3%A3o%20da%20Estiva%2C%20Pescaria%20Brava%2C%20SC&z=12&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" title="Mapa de Pescaria Brava - SC" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      <span class="location__pin">✦</span>
    </div>
    <ul class="location__list">
      <li class="loc-item" data-reveal>
        <span class="loc-item__num">01</span>
        <div><h3>Ponte de Laguna</h3><p>7 km · a porta de entrada para a histórica Laguna</p></div>
        <span class="loc-item__arrow">→</span>
      </li>
      <li class="loc-item" data-reveal>
        <span class="loc-item__num">02</span>
        <div><h3>Praias &amp; Lagoas</h3><p>Litoral selvagem, lagoas e pores do sol de cinema</p></div>
        <span class="loc-item__arrow">→</span>
      </li>
      <li class="loc-item" data-reveal>
        <span class="loc-item__num">03</span>
        <div><h3>Centro Histórico</h3><p>Anita Garibaldi, ruas de pedra e cultura açoriana</p></div>
        <span class="loc-item__arrow">→</span>
      </li>
      <li class="loc-item" data-reveal>
        <span class="loc-item__num">04</span>
        <div><h3>Serra &amp; Mata</h3><p>Trilhas, cachoeiras e a natureza do sul do Brasil</p></div>
        <span class="loc-item__arrow">→</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="location__addr" data-reveal>
    <span class="location__addr-icon">✦</span>
    <p>Estrada Geral Sertão da Estiva, Pescaria Brava — Santa Catarina, Brasil</p>
    <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sert%C3%A3o+da+Estiva+Pescaria+Brava+SC" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-link btn-link--light" data-cursor="link">Abrir no mapa <span>→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
